# Scotty must not grant the graveyard cast during the opponent's main phase or its controller's upkeep (CR 101.2, 601.3).
# The same Bolt is then cast in the controller's main phase, proving the refusals are timing restrictions.
# Scotty gives each instant and sorcery card in Bot1's graveyard beam me up during its controller's main phase: on turn 3
# the Lightning Bolt that burned Bot2 on turn 1 is cast for {R} plus returning Ornithopter to its owner's hand, and is
# exiled as it leaves the stack. Two Black Lotuses pay for the Bolt and for Scotty's {1}{U}{U}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Scotty, Miracle Worker
Lightning Bolt
Ornithopter
Island x2
Mountain
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

